Mother of the Changeling Child by Xenakis - info

summary:

Catra and Adora live alone on a hill on the edge of the Whispering Woods, they had a kid.
As tragedy strikes, and Catra couldn't accept it, she went into the deepest parts of the Whispering Woods where it was said you could meet faeries who would grant your wishes.

Time goes by and they “raise” Finn for years, yet eventually it becomes obvious they’re not… growing. So Catra takes Finn to visit Mme Razz who asks her what she wished for. With the whole story,
she explains “A baby is what you wished for. And the faeries… They keep their promises, Deary”.

Can the couple strike a new deal with the faeries? What will this entail? Will Catra, Adora, and Finn get their happy ending?
Long, long ago in Etheria, there was a modest but cozy cabin on a hill at the edge of the Whispering Woods. If I was there that time, I would not be here now. But as I am, I have one small story.


